{"4291840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Floors of Fate", "steam_appid": 4291840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASCEND THE TOWER. DEFY FATE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Floors of Fate</strong> is a dark fantasy Action RPG and Dungeon Crawler where you climb a massive, 50-floor tower filled with ancient horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where history has faded, you are a lone warrior driven toward the summit. The path upward is unforgiving—guarded by merciless enemies, deadly traps, and fragments of a story hidden within the tower itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/99891414384e15f5d86d2bd5f0d26b45.poster.avif?t=1787925436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/99891414384e15f5d86d2bd5f0d26b45.webm?t=1787925436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/99891414384e15f5d86d2bd5f0d26b45.mp4?t=1787925436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Biomes &amp; Boss Themes:</strong> The tower is alive. Biomes shift every 5–10 floors, changing atmosphere to reflect the essence of the upcoming Boss. Survive dense forests, arid deserts, and twisted dungeons that foreshadow the dangers ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Hack &amp; Slash Combat:</strong> A responsive action combat system focused on timing, positioning, and stamina management. Dodge lethal strikes, block when necessary, and punish enemies when openings appear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Build System (Alkir &amp; Runes):</strong> It’s not just about stats. Absorb <strong>Boss Runes</strong> to unlock a powerful sixth active ability—turning your enemy’s power against them. Use the <strong>Alkir System</strong> at Goddess statues to modify skills, reduce cooldowns, or add new utility like dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling:</strong> No lengthy cutscenes. Encounter cryptic NPCs, decipher lost notes, and read the environment to piece together the tragic truth behind the Floors of Fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Altars &amp; Unique Loot:</strong> Exploration is rewarded. Discover hidden altars to trigger <strong>Time Attack</strong> challenges and earn specialized weapons imbued with unique effects such as poison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Upon completing the tower, your total clear time is recorded. Compete with players worldwide and prove how far—and how fast—you can climb.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PURGATORY SYSTEM (CHALLENGER DIFFICULTY)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Floors of Fate</strong>, death is not always the end—but only for those who seek the ultimate challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On <strong>Challenger Difficulty</strong>, falling in battle sends you to <strong>Purgatory</strong>—a shadowed realm beyond the tower where one final trial awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/57716234e790db4138567cb3878bd8b3.poster.avif?t=1787925436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/57716234e790db4138567cb3878bd8b3.webm?t=1787925436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/57716234e790db4138567cb3878bd8b3.mp4?t=1787925436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn a Second Chance:</strong> Survive the trial to return and continue your ascent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk Everything:</strong> Fail in Purgatory, and your run ends permanently. This mode features <strong>Permadeath</strong>, erasing all progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lower difficulty modes offer a more forgiving experience, allowing players to learn the tower without the threat of permanent loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WILL YOU REACH THE SUMMIT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tower stands silent and unmoving. Prepare yourself, step forward, and see how far you can climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/cd21aa1fdb018f96f8941cf43f4a1bd6.poster.avif?t=1787925436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/cd21aa1fdb018f96f8941cf43f4a1bd6.webm?t=1787925436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/cd21aa1fdb018f96f8941cf43f4a1bd6.mp4?t=1787925436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASCEND T