ystem (Alkir &amp; Runes):</strong> It’s not just about stats. Absorb <strong>Boss Runes</strong> to unlock a powerful sixth active ability—turning your enemy’s power against them. Use the <strong>Alkir System</strong> at Goddess statues to modify skills, reduce cooldowns, or add new utility like dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling:</strong> No lengthy cutscenes. Encounter cryptic NPCs, decipher lost notes, and read the environment to piece together the tragic truth behind the Floors of Fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Altars &amp; Unique Loot:</strong> Exploration is rewarded. Discover hidden altars to trigger <strong>Time Attack</strong> challenges and earn specialized weapons imbued with unique effects such as poison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Upon completing the tower, your total clear time is recorded. Compete with players worldwide and prove how far—and how fast—you can climb.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PURGATORY SYSTEM (CHALLENGER DIFFICULTY)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Floors of Fate</strong>, death is not always the end—but only for those who seek the ultimate challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On <strong>Challenger Difficulty</strong>, falling in battle sends you to <strong>Purgatory</strong>—a shadowed realm beyond the tower where one final trial awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/57716234e790db4138567cb3878bd8b3.poster.avif?t=1787925436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291840/extras/57716234e790db4138567cb3878bd8b3.webm?t=1787925436\" 